# MSI Mystic Light motherboards (1462:7d77 on MS-7D77).
# GROUP="wheel" gives the lingering user service access at boot, before a
# desktop login exists. TAG+="uaccess" still grants the active desktop user
# access on systems where that user is not in wheel.
SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="1462", ATTRS{idProduct}=="7d77", TAG+="uaccess", GROUP="wheel", MODE="0660"
